% Based in part on Marc Corluy's uconnthesis.cls (Summer 2007), available at:
% https://math.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3655/2019/01/CorluyClass.zip
% Corluy's header credits Marijan Kostrun's earlier class (2001),
