% Change history
% 2011-03: Marcos O. Prates created this adapted Statistics version (0.1).
% 2017-05: Gregory Vaughn contributed improvements to the template.
% 2026-09-27: Jun Yan revised and improved the template, with Codex assistance:
%   - Updated page geometry, spacing, and preliminary-page numbering.
%   - Improved abstract, title, copyright, and approval-page layouts.
%   - Added optional signature lines and support for two co-major advisors.
%   - Improved theorem styles, contents, and lists of tables and figures.
%   - Supported PDF navigation without duplicate abstract page destinations.
%   - Replaced PDE and group-theory examples with statistical inference.
%   - Added bootstrap pseudocode, punctuated cases, and sentence-case sections.
%   - Linked figure and table guidance to Statistical Writing.
%   - Added independent Rnw examples, default knitr rendering, and R figures.
%   - Kept figure captions and labels explicit in LaTeX.
%   - Documented float placement settings and added subtle blue hyperlinks.
%   - Generalized Rnw builds and deep cleaning of generated files.
%   - Tracked figure dependencies and prevented reuse of failed knit outputs.
%   - Added build regression checks and CI checks for missing outputs/logs.
% See REVIEW.md for validation and remaining submission-compliance gaps.
